{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Hey Caroline, that roadtrip this past weekend was insane! We were all freaked when my son got into an accident. We were so lucky he was okay. It was a real scary experience. Thankfully it's over now. What's been up since we last talked?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-cff2bb227deffc896168b944", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.825262+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "cff2bb227deffc896168b944", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "cff2bb227deffc896168b944", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Oops, sorry 'bout the accident! Must have been traumatizing for you guys. Thank goodness your son's okay. Life sure can be a roller coaster."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-fc8cc006a4c31ca182715438", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.849111+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fc8cc006a4c31ca182715438", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fc8cc006a4c31ca182715438", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Yeah, our trip got off to a bad start. I was really scared when we got into the accident. Thankfully, my son's ok and that was a reminder that life is precious and to cherish our family."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-0bd765e44ca1e1a136b4d728", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.860183+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0bd765e44ca1e1a136b4d728", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0bd765e44ca1e1a136b4d728", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Glad your son is okay, Melanie. Life's unpredictable, but moments like these remind us how important our loved ones are. Family's everything."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-4eec475647cd6533ddd38367", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.874153+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "4eec475647cd6533ddd38367", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "4eec475647cd6533ddd38367", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Yeah, you're right, Caroline. Family's super important to me. Especially after the accident, I've thought a lot about how much I need them. They mean the world to me and I'm so thankful to have them. Thankfully, they enjoyed the Grand Canyon a lot!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-d06e4ecc1ae67c71165c4435", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.889900+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d06e4ecc1ae67c71165c4435", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d06e4ecc1ae67c71165c4435", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: The kids look so cute, Mel! I bet they bring lots of joy. How did they handle the accident?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-beaa3a97015fb81644f955cf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.906681+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "beaa3a97015fb81644f955cf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "beaa3a97015fb81644f955cf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks! They were scared but we reassured them and explained their brother would be OK. They're tough kids."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-77f9f9cb0b7386448ee4fee0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.915634+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "77f9f9cb0b7386448ee4fee0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "77f9f9cb0b7386448ee4fee0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Kids are amazingly resilient in tough situations. They have an amazing ability to bounce back."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-8c776a2ce17e15f866e147b7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.929615+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8c776a2ce17e15f866e147b7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8c776a2ce17e15f866e147b7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: They're really amazing. Wish I was that resilient too. But they give me the strength to keep going."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-a08208302a8e93f7b6030c5e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.943412+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a08208302a8e93f7b6030c5e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a08208302a8e93f7b6030c5e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Our loved ones give us strength to tackle any challenge - it's amazing!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-c11d507d15991aad44815ca5", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.956716+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c11d507d15991aad44815ca5", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c11d507d15991aad44815ca5", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Yeah, Caroline. Totally agree. They're my biggest motivation and support."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-e38351996c3dd3f29cfead12", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.964314+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e38351996c3dd3f29cfead12", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e38351996c3dd3f29cfead12", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: It's so sweet to see your love for your family, Melanie. They really are your rock."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-5d6fc19538ccffb774fa4006", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.978222+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5d6fc19538ccffb774fa4006", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5d6fc19538ccffb774fa4006", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline. They're a real support. Appreciate them a lot."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-2a1e93dc9590fa16a4aee10e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:46.991958+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a1e93dc9590fa16a4aee10e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a1e93dc9590fa16a4aee10e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Glad you've got people to lean on, Melanie. It helps during tougher times."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-7c259221c5cc019832b3e582", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.001106+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7c259221c5cc019832b3e582", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7c259221c5cc019832b3e582", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Yeah for sure. Having my fam around helps a lot. It makes hard times easier."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-36a1026d557bc3c752a1cf0e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.014905+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "36a1026d557bc3c752a1cf0e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "36a1026d557bc3c752a1cf0e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Wow, great pic! Is that recent? Looks like you all had fun!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-1bf201e23f34eb5e652aef8f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.027236+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1bf201e23f34eb5e652aef8f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1bf201e23f34eb5e652aef8f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! Yup, we just did it yesterday! The kids loved it and it was a nice way to relax after the road trip."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-c0695292d3d9da0526a1d2ac", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.037875+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c0695292d3d9da0526a1d2ac", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c0695292d3d9da0526a1d2ac", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Glad you got some R&R after the drive. Nature sure seems to refresh us, huh?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-e7b6f59d3f772a3267b9e6e0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.050645+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e7b6f59d3f772a3267b9e6e0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e7b6f59d3f772a3267b9e6e0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Absolutely! It really helps me reset and recharge. I love camping trips with my fam, 'cause nature brings such peace and serenity."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-49cf8baabb37b772e3632177", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.064134+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "49cf8baabb37b772e3632177", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "49cf8baabb37b772e3632177", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Wow, that's awesome! What do you love most about camping with your fam?"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-c0ba731b835e8d1a14a88331", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.077543+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "c0ba731b835e8d1a14a88331", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "c0ba731b835e8d1a14a88331", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: It's a chance to be present and together. We bond over stories, campfires and nature. It's so peaceful waking up to the sound of birds and the smell of fresh air - it always refreshes my soul."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-f5b788278940ea4db1568df1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.089237+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f5b788278940ea4db1568df1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f5b788278940ea4db1568df1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: That's so peaceful and calming, Melanie! I can picture waking up to nature. It's great that you get to spend quality, tranquil time with your family."}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-65af5d66c58678c08057bf63", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.103283+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "65af5d66c58678c08057bf63", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "65af5d66c58678c08057bf63", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Melanie: Thanks, Caroline! This is a great time. Nature and quality time, can't beat it!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-505f46f340a46380c3b104f6", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.117045+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "505f46f340a46380c3b104f6", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "505f46f340a46380c3b104f6", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Caroline: Yeah totally! They're priceless. Lucky you!"}, "creation_event": "v2-ingest-3.3-V2-FULL-2026-09-08-locomo-conv-26/session_18-d67621925a5f0b4cb8cde338", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-08T08:46:47.130887+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "d67621925a5f0b4cb8cde338", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "d67621925a5f0b4cb8cde338", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
